# Copy to .env.local for local development (never commit .env.local).
# On Vercel, add the same variable under Project → Settings → Environment Variables.

# GitHub fine-grained personal access token (no extra permissions needed — public data only).
# Enables the official GitHub GraphQL API for the contribution graph and repo count.
# Without it, the site falls back to a public mirror of the calendar.
GITHUB_TOKEN=
